      <p begin="00:24.070" end="00:26.910" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">'Cause I want you and you know that (yeah)</p>
      <p begin="00:26.910" end="00:29.880" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">And I need you and you know that (yeah)</p>
      <p begin="00:29.880" end="00:32.650" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Wanna love you and you know that (yeah)</p>
      <p begin="00:32.650" end="00:35.610" ttm:agent="v1">Who said love don't last forever?</p>
      <p begin="00:35.610" end="00:37.530" ttm:agent="v1">Hmm, hmm</p>
